---
description: Keep agent commands aligned with GitHub Actions CI
globs: .github/workflows/**,.agents/commands/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# CI parity

- Source of truth: `.github/workflows/test.yml`, `lint.yml`, `audit.yml`.
- When workflows change, update only `.agents/commands/*` (never `.cursor/commands`).
- Default local/CI commands must **not** use `--all-features` (CUDA).
- Formatting checks use `cargo +nightly fmt` because of unstable rustfmt options.
- Clippy and tests use stable with default features.
- Generate `Cargo.lock` in CI when missing; the lockfile is gitignored for the library.
